---
import DocumentIcon from './DocumentIcon.astro';
---

<section class="policy-section">
      <h2>
        <DocumentIcon name="circle-alert" />
        Supported Payment Platforms
      </h2>
      <p>Better Keep Notes Pro subscriptions can be purchased through the following platforms:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <DocumentIcon name="check" />
          <span><strong>Google Play Store</strong> – Android devices</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <DocumentIcon name="check" />
          <span><strong>Apple App Store</strong> – iOS and macOS devices</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <DocumentIcon name="check" />
          <span><strong>Razorpay</strong> – Web platform (betterkeep.app)</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="policy-section">
      <h2>
        <DocumentIcon name="credit-card" />
        Subscription Cancellation
      </h2>
      <p>You can cancel your Pro subscription at any time. The cancellation process depends on where you purchased your
        subscription:</p>

      <div class="document-platform-card">
        <h4>Google Play Store (Android)</h4>
        <p>
          Tapping "Cancel Subscription" in the app will open the <strong>Google Play Store subscription
            management</strong> page.
          You'll complete the cancellation through Google Play directly.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your subscription remains active until the end of your
            current billing period</li>
          <li>After cancellation, you won't be charged again</li>
          <li>You can resubscribe at any time from within the app</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="document-platform-card">
        <h4>Apple App Store (iOS/macOS)</h4>
        <p>
          Tapping "Cancel Subscription" in the app will open the <strong>App Store subscription management</strong>
          page.
          You'll complete the cancellation through Apple directly.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your subscription remains active until the end of your
            current billing period</li>
          <li>After cancellation, you won't be charged again</li>
          <li>You can resubscribe at any time from within the app</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="document-platform-card">
        <h4>Razorpay (Web)</h4>
        <p>
          Tapping "Cancel Subscription" will cancel your subscription <strong>at the end of your current billing
            cycle</strong>.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>You'll continue to have Pro access until your subscription
            expires</li>
          <li>Your subscription will not auto-renew</li>
          <li>Once cancelled, you cannot undo the cancellation (Razorpay
            limitation)</li>
          <li>You can purchase a new subscription after your current one
            expires</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="note-box">
        <h4>
          <DocumentIcon name="circle-alert" />
          Important: All Cancellations Take Effect at End of Billing Period
        </h4>
        <p>
          For all platforms, cancellation stops future renewals but you keep Pro access until your current billing
          period ends.
          Your notes always remain safe and accessible locally, even after your subscription expires.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="policy-section">
      <h2>
        <DocumentIcon name="receipt" />
        Refund Policy
      </h2>
      <p>Our refund policy varies depending on how you purchased your subscription:</p>

      <div class="document-platform-card">
        <h4>Google Play Store (Android)</h4>
        <p>
          Refunds for subscriptions purchased through Google Play are handled according to
          <a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/2479637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's refund
            policy</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can request a refund directly through Google Play within 48 hours of purchase.
          For refunds outside this window, please contact our support team.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="document-platform-card">
        <h4>Apple App Store (iOS/macOS)</h4>
        <p>
          Refunds for subscriptions purchased through the App Store are handled according to
          <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT204084" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apple's refund policy</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can request a refund through Apple's Report a Problem page or by contacting Apple Support.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="document-platform-card">
        <h4>Razorpay (Web)</h4>
        <p>
          For subscriptions purchased through our website via Razorpay, we offer a <strong>30-day money-back
            guarantee</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you're not satisfied with Pro within the first 30 days, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:contact@betterkeep.app">contact@betterkeep.app</a> for a full refund.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="policy-section">
      <h2>
        <DocumentIcon name="circle-alert" />
        Important Notes
      </h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <DocumentIcon name="check" />
          <span>Cancelling your subscription does <strong>not</strong> delete your account or data</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <DocumentIcon name="check" />
          <span>Your locally stored notes are always accessible, even after subscription ends</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <DocumentIcon name="check" />
          <span>Cloud-synced notes will remain on your device but won't sync new changes until you resubscribe</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <DocumentIcon name="check" />
          <span>You can export all your data at any time from the app settings</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <DocumentIcon name="check" />
          <span>For Google Play and App Store subscriptions, you can resubscribe anytime from within the app</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <DocumentIcon name="check" />
          <span>For Razorpay (web) subscriptions, you can purchase a new subscription after your current one
            expires</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-section">
      <h2>Need Help?</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about cancellations, refunds, or billing,
        please don't hesitate to reach out. We're here to help!
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Contact Support</a>
    </section>
